        "Content": "LWK Group in association with Keane Mahony Smith\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nComing to the market------Register your interest\r\n\r\nKeane Mahony Smith /Lenard Keenan Wilson are delighted to offer for sale this solid two-storey family home in a most sought-after and convenient location within walking distance of all major amenities. This is a very bright and spacious 3-bedroom home presented in good condition throughout. This lovely property has accommodation extending to close on 1,237 square feet (115m2 incl. garage). This well-loved family home has been maintained to a good standard over the years but could use some upgrading and modernisation. A great opportunity at an affordable price\r\n\r\n·       Brief resume; Hall, Family room, Kitchen, Livingroom. Attached garage, 3 beds, main bathroom overhead\r\n\r\n·       Excellent front & rear gardens\r\n\r\n·       Natural gas central heating\r\n\r\n·       Great schools and sports amenities nearby.\r\n\r\n·       Double glazed windows\r\n\r\n·       Built in 1970\r\n\r\n·       Attached Garage\r\n\r\n·       Foundation remediation works completed 2026\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
